# EvtGen user decay file for k4DTF test samples
#
#   B- -> D0 K-,  D0 -> KS pi+ pi-  (+ c.c.)
#
# Decay descriptor (k4DTF / LHCb notation):
#   B- -> (D0 -> KS pi+ pi-) K-
#
# Use with DelphesPythia8EvtGen_EDM4HEP_k4Interface ... 521 Bu_SIGNAL 1

Alias      Bu_SIGNAL       B+
Alias      Bubar_SIGNAL    B-
ChargeConj Bu_SIGNAL       Bubar_SIGNAL
#
Alias      MyD0            D0
Alias      MyAnti-D0       anti-D0
ChargeConj MyD0            MyAnti-D0
#
Alias myK_S0  K_S0
ChargeConj myK_S0 myK_S0
#
Decay Bubar_SIGNAL
  1.000    MyD0       K-           PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay Bu_SIGNAL
#
Decay MyD0
  1.000    myK_S0   pi+    pi-         PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay MyAnti-D0
#
Decay myK_S0
1.000     pi+  pi-                      PHSP;
Enddecay
#
End
